  "body": "## 📝 更新日志\n## [v3.0.33]\n\n### 功能更新\n\n- 进度条跟随从右到左阅读方向反转\n- 添加墨水屏优化 by [dororo42](https://github.com/dororo42)\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复搜索栏部分情况下无法正常搜索的问题\n- 修复低版本安卓闪退 by [dororo42](https://github.com/dororo42)\n\n### 优化\n\n- 优化搜索栏弹出逻辑\n\n---\n\n### 📦 推荐下载\n| 平台 | 下载链接 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Windows** | [windows-installer-v3.0.33.exe](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.33/windows-installer-v3.0.33.exe) |\n| **macOS** | [Breeze-macOS-v3.0.33.dmg](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.33/Breeze-macOS-v3.0.33.dmg) |\n| **Android** | [app-arm64-v8a-release-v3.0.33.apk](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.33/app-arm64-v8a-release-v3.0.33.apk) |\n| **iOS** | [Breeze-iOS-v3.0.33.ipa](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.33/Breeze-iOS-v3.0.33.ipa) |\n| **Linux** | [breeze-v3.0.33.flatpak](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.33/breeze-v3.0.33.flatpak) |\n| **Linux (DEB)** | [breeze_3.0.33_amd64-v3.0.33.deb](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.33/breeze_3.0.33_amd64-v3.0.33.deb) |\n\n> 💡 **不知道该下载哪个文件？**\n> 请查看 [详细安装指南](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze#-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85)。\n"
